Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Arizona State University. Currently, ASU does not offer or accept application fee waivers. The application fee to apply to ASU is $70 and can be paid online at the time a student applies or can be sent in as a check or money order. Please let me know if you have any other questions.

{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
{!User.Title}
Admission Services

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
